=====================================
Switch-Case Statements (dooro/xaalad)
=====================================
\n1. Basic switch with integer:
Testing with number = 2
Laba (Two)
\n2. Switch with strings:
Testing with language = Somali
Salaan, Adduunka!
\n3. Switch with expressions:
Testing with x = 10 and y = 20
Sum is 30
\n4. Switch with decimal values:
Testing with price = 19.99
Standard item
\n5. Nested switch statements:
Testing with department = 1 and level = 2
Engineering Department
- Senior Engineer
\n6. Switch with boolean expression:
Testing with score = 85
High score achieved!
\nSwitch-case demonstration completed!
